WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.700
Ryu falls after the prerequisite Arc-Step kick.

2
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:01.300
Kimberly advances with raw Rush.

3
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:01.800
Back heavy kick connects from Rush.

4
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:02.800
Standing medium punch links into the heavy-punch target.

5
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:03.700
Sprint reaches the automatic Arc Step.

6
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:04.900
The follow-up kick completes the conversion.

7
00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:05.250
Both fighters have returned to standing after the completed knockdown route.
